	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"stamp all documents" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the senior accountant in your department. 
When sending to the senior accountant in your department is completed, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
After creating a receiving report, one or more of the following paths should be executed: gathering the receiving report, confirming all documents have been amended. 
After that, stamping all documents needs to be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
